Abstract = {The database presented in this data article is related to the article
   ``Adaptive planting design and management framework for urban climate
   change adaptation and mitigation `` {[}1] . It includes a list of 287
   plant species presently occurring in Porto, Portugal, more precisely in
   urban green spaces with high urban ecological novelty levels. The plant
   species in this list were classified and organized according to several
   traits with a particular focus on plant species' adaptation, mitigation,
   and ornamental characteristics. Data collection resorted to articles,
   books, and various open access and online datasets. Data were organized
   in an Excel file that organizes information on more than 50 plant
